                <div class="c-box w-for-tips-custom-style">
                    <div class="article-hero">
                        <h1>Genshin Impact | How to Reach Level 100 &amp; Characters to Prioritize</h1>
                        <div class="_info">
                            <div class="walkthrough-last-update">
                                <span class="_text">Last Updated: <time datetime="2026-09-18T12:19-05:00">September 18, 2026 12:19 PM</time></span>
                            </div>
                            <button class="comment-direct js-link-to-comment">
                                <div class="comment-count">
                                    <i class="c-comment-icon is-pushed"></i>
                                    <span class="comment-direct-num">0</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="comment-instruction">
                                    <span>See latest comments</span>
                                    <i class="i-expand-down-arrow"></i>
                                </div>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                                                    <div class="article-ogimage-2-wrap">
                                <img src="https://img.gamewith.net/article/thumbnail/rectangle/70231.png" alt="Genshin Impact | How to Reach Level 100 &amp; Characters to Prioritize - GameWith" class="article-ogimage-2">
                            </div>
                                            </div>
                    <div class="article-wrap">
                        <script type="application/ld+json">
{
    "@context": "http://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/70231"
    },
        "headline": "Genshin Impact | How to Reach Level 100 &amp; Characters to Prioritize",
                    "description": "How to Reach Level 95 to 100  &amp; Characters to Prioritize in Genshin Impact. See how to reach level 95, level 100, increase character ascension limit to 100, &amp; who to level to 100!",
                        "articleBody": " How to Reach Level 95 to 100  &amp; Characters to Prioritize in Genshin Impact. See how to reach level 95, level 100, increase character ascension limit to 100, &amp; who to level to 100!Table of ContentsHow to Reach Level 95 and 100?How To Get Masterless FortunaPriority Characters To Level UpHow to Reach Level 95 and 100? Starting from Level 90 Use Masterless Fortuna To Raise A Character by 5 LevelsHow to Level Up1-90EXP Books, Boss Drops, Specialty, Elemental Gems90-95 Masterless Fortuna x195-100 Masterless Fortuna x2 To level a character from Level 90, you need to use Masterless Fortuna. You do not need EXP Books and other materials for this.How to Get &amp; Use Masterless Fortuna Get The Masterless Fortuna Through Gacha Pulls You can get Masterless Fortuna by pulling another 5-star that already has maxed out constellation. The extra character/constellation will automatically give a Masterless Fortuna. Used To Raise Characters Up To Lv. 100 Masterless Fortuna can be used to level up your characters up to Lv. 95 and up to Lv. 100. Note that you can only level up a character to its maximum level cap if your character is already at Level 90. Which Character to Level up to 100? &amp; Who Benefits the Most? Recommended Characters to Ascend Up to Lv. 100Highest Priority(Transformative Reaction Triggers)NahidaRaiden(Hyperbloom)IneffaFlinsLaumaYae MikoKokomi (Bloom)Kuki ShinobuHigh Priority(Transformative Reaction Characters) AlhaithamNilouCynoTighnariBarbara (Bloom)ClorindeMedium Priority(High Damage Characters &amp; Bennett)BennettNeuvilletteMavuikaSkirkMualaniArlecchinoChascaKinich Transformative Reaction Gains The Most Buffs From Level Increase Transformative Reaction such as Bloom, Hyperbloom, Burgeon, Electro-Charge etc, scales from the character&#039;s Level Multiplier (Level of the character). Because of this, characters who mainly deal damage by triggering such reactions gains the most damage increase from increasing max level. The One Dealing The Reaction Is The PrioritySimilar to all reactions, the stats of the character dealing or triggering the reaction is where the damage is calculated from so characters who has the most ownership in the reactions should be the biggest priority for maxing level over other transformative reaction characters. META Characters Are Also Good Options Increasing the max level of the character also increases their Base ATK, DEF and HP. This can increase the damage of any characters no matter which stats they scale. Bennett Is Also a Good Option Bennett&#039;s ATK buff increases based on Base ATK so increasing Bennett&#039;s Max Level will effectively increase Bennett&#039;s Base ATK. Since Bennett is a 4-star character, the base ATK increase will not be will not be significant compared to leveling the character being buffed itself. However, Bennett can be slotted in any ATK scaling team.Character Related Articles Character Tier ListsTier ListsBest Characters Tier ListBest Teams For Each CharacterMeta Team CompsAll CharactersCharacters By Rarity★5★4Characters By RolesDPS ListSupport ListSustain ListOn-Field ListOff-Field ListCharacters By ElementPyroHydroAnemoElectroDendroCryoGeoCharacters By NationMondstadtLiyueInazumaSumeru FontaineNatlanSnezhnayaNod-KraiList Of All Characters",
    
            
"image": 
        [
