<hr class="article-hero-hr">
<div id="article-body" class="">
    <style>.genshin_center table{text-align: center;table-layout: fixed;}.genshin_team tr td:nth-child(1){text-align: center;}.genshin_team img{display: inline-block !important;vertical-align: middle;}.genshin_substitute tr td:nth-child(1){text-align: center;}.genshin_substitute tr td:nth-child(2){text-align: center;}.genshin_footer table{text-align: center;table-layout: fixed;font-weight: bolder;}.genshin_footer_enemies table{text-align: center;table-layout: fixed;font-weight: bolder;}.genshin_footer_enemies img{border-radius:10px;}.genshin_img_adjust table tr td{padding: 2px 2px !important;}.genshin_img_adjust .w-article-img{margin-bottom:2px!important;}.genshin_img_adjust table{table-layout:fixed;}</style><p> <span class='sub-info'>How to Reach Level 95 to 100  & Characters to Prioritize in Genshin Impact. See how to reach level 95, level 100, increase character ascension limit to 100, & who to level to 100!</span></p><div class="article_outline"><p><span class='bolder'>Table of Contents</span></p><ul><li><a href='#upgrade' >How to Reach Level 95 and 100?</a></li><li><a href='#how' >How To Get Masterless Fortuna</a></li><li><a href='#one' >Priority Characters To Level Up</a></li></ul></div><!-- .article_outline --><h2 id="how">How to Reach Level 95 and 100?</h2><h3> Starting from Level 90 Use Masterless Fortuna To Raise A Character by 5 Levels</h3><table><tr><th colspan="2" width="30%">How to Level Up</th></tr><tr><th width="30%">1-90</th><td width="70%">EXP Books, Boss Drops, Specialty, Elemental Gems</td></tr><tr><th width="30%">90-95</th><td width="70%"> Masterless Fortuna x1</td></tr><tr><th width="30%">95-100</th><td width="70%"> Masterless Fortuna x2</td></tr></table><p> To level a character from Level 90, you need to use Masterless Fortuna. You do not need EXP Books and other materials for this.</p><h2 id="how">How to Get & Use Masterless Fortuna</h2><h3> Get The Masterless Fortuna Through Gacha Pulls</h3><div style='width:100%;' class='w-article-img'><div class='js-lazyload-img-wrap c-thumb-placeholder' style='padding-bottom:56%'><img class='c-progressive-img' src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://img.gamewith.net/img/6ed58b185bef01a5ea52546f9cc8d0da.png' data-use-lazyload='true' alt='Genshin Impact max level cap'></div></div><noscript><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/img/6ed58b185bef01a5ea52546f9cc8d0da.png' alt='Genshin Impact max level cap' /></noscript><p> You can <span style='color:red;'>get Masterless Fortuna by pulling another 5-star that already has maxed out constellation</span>. The extra character/constellation will automatically give a Masterless Fortuna.</p><h4> Used To Raise Characters Up To Lv. 100</h4><p> Masterless Fortuna can be used to level up your characters up to Lv. 95 and up to Lv. 100. Note that <span style='color:red;'>you can only level up a character to its maximum level cap if your character is already at Level 90</span>. </p><h2 id="one">Which Character to Level up to 100? & Who Benefits the Most?</h2><h3> Recommended Characters to Ascend Up to Lv. 100</h3><table><tr><th colspan="8">Highest Priority<br>(Transformative Reaction Triggers)</th></tr><tr><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/33274' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_93.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Nahida'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_93.png' alt='Nahida' /></noscript>Nahida</a></td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/24184' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_42.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Raiden Shogun'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_42.png' alt='Raiden Shogun' /></noscript>Raiden</a><br>(Hyperbloom)</td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/68225' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_85.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Ineffa'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_85.png' alt='Ineffa' /></noscript>Ineffa</a></td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/69307' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_88.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Flins'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_88.png' alt='Flins' /></noscript>Flins</a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/69281' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_86.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Lauma'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_86.png' alt='Lauma' /></noscript>Lauma</a></td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/24650' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_61.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Yae Miko'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_61.png' alt='Yae Miko' /></noscript>Yae Miko</a></td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/24455' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_48.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Sangonomiya Kokomi'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_48.png' alt='Sangonomiya Kokomi' /></noscript>Kokomi</a> (Bloom)</td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/29488' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_75.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Kuki Shinobu'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_75.png' alt='Kuki Shinobu' /></noscript>Kuki Shinobu</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan="8">High Priority<br>(Transformative Reaction Characters) </th></tr><tr><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/33663' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_89.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Alhaitham'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_89.png' alt='Alhaitham' /></noscript>Alhaitham</a></td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/31554' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_90.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Nilou'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_90.png' alt='Nilou' /></noscript>Nilou</a></td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/24371' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_43.png' data-use-lazyload='true' width=50px height=50px class='js-lazyload-fixed-size-img c-blank-img w-article-img' alt='Cyno'><noscript><img src='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_43.png' alt='Cyno' /></noscript>Cyno</a></td><td colspan="2", style="text-align:center"><a href='https://gamewith.net/genshin-impact/article/show/33276' ><img src='https://img.gamewith.net/assets/images/common/transparent1px.png' data-original='https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gamewith-en/article_tools/genshin-impact/gacha/chara_